    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo ma gibedo i Jerucalem guketo Akajia ma wode matidine odoko kabaka ma oleyo ka tyene; pien mony pa jo ma yam gubino i gony kacel ki jo Arab gutyeko neko awobe madito woko ducu. En gin mumiyo Akajia wod pa kabaka Jekoram me Juda ocamo ker. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akajia onoŋo ditte romo mwaka pyeraŋwen wiye aryo ka ocamo ker, ci obedo ka loci Jerucalem pi mwaka acel. Minne nyiŋe Atalia; en yam lakwar Omri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akajia bene obedo ka lubo kit pa jo me ot pa Akab, pien minne aye obedo ka miye tam me tiyo gin maraco, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obedo ka tiyo gin ma nen marac i wan Rwot, kit macalo jo me ot pa Akab gubedo ka tiyone; pien gin aye gubedo ka miye tam me tiyo gin marac i kare ma wonne doŋ oto, ci gutere i to. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En bene oye tamgi, ocito gin ki Jekoram wod pa Akab kabaka me Icrael ka lweny ki Kajael kabaka me Ciria i Ramot-gilead. Jo Ciria guketo ret i kom Joram, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci en odwogo ka mado rette i Jejreel, en aye waŋ ret ma jo Ciria guketo i kome ki i Rama i kare ma en olwenyo i kom Kajael kabaka me Ciria. Akajia wod pa Jekoram kabaka me Juda ocito ka limo Joram wod pa Akab i Jejreel, pien onoŋo kome lit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lubaŋa onoŋo doŋ otyeko yubo ni Akajia bito i kare ma en bicito ka limo Joram. Pien ka ocito kunnu ci onywako wot gin ki Jekoram pi rwatte ki Yeko wod pa Nimci, ma Rwot onoŋo owiro wek omuk jo me ot pa Akab woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare ma Yeko tye ka cobo lok ma Rwot oŋolo i kom jo me ot pa Akab, en orwatte ki ludito me Juda bene ki awobe pa omegi Akajia, ma gitiyo bot Akajia, ci onekogi woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En obedo ka yenyo Akajia, ci gimako en ki i Camaria ka ma okanne iye, gikelo en bot Yeko ci Yeko oneke woko, Guyike, pien guwacci, “En lakwar Yekocapat, ma yam obedo ka yenyo Rwot ki cwinye ducu.” Dano mo pe odoŋ i ot pa Akajia ma romo camo ker,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Atalia min Akajia oneno ni wode oto woko, ci en ocako jwero jo me dog ot ker pa Juda woko ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Yekocabeat nya pa kabaka, otiŋo Yoaci wod pa Akajia, ci okwalo woko ki i kin awobe pa kabaka ma gibenekogi-ni, ci okano en ki lapidine i kicika mo me buto. Yekocabeat, ma nya pa kabaka Jekoram obedo dako pa ajwaka Yekoyada, en lamiŋ Akajia; okano Yoaci woko ki bot Atalia kit meno, omiyo Atalia pe oneke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En obedo kwedgi mwaka abicel, kun gikano en i ot pa Lubaŋa i kare ma Atalia tye ka loyo lobo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
